| 4 | Total Aggregated CTs (Download) / 总聚合密文 | `sum(aggregated_ciphertexts) = 3450` | 3450 blocks |
| 5 | Avg Single CT Size / 平均单密文大小 | `14416286429/43125 = 334291` | 326.46 KB |
