| 9 | Total Communication / 总通信 | `1021070180804 + 1008024363125 = 2029094543929` | 1935095.35 MB |
| 10 | Avg Expansion / 平均膨胀率 | `mean(expansion_ratio) = 10.5212` | 10.52x |
